# This local synthetic baseline requires no secrets, tokens or environment variables.
# Database location, scenario, request key and as-of time are explicit CLI arguments.
# Optional synthetic HTTP server (environment variables, not automatically loaded):
# AEGISFLOW_AUTH_FILE=work/api-auth.json
# AEGISFLOW_SCENARIO_FILE=fixtures/supply-delay-v1.json
# AEGISFLOW_DB=work/api.db
# Optional PostgreSQL runtime connection; set outside version control:
# AEGISFLOW_DATABASE_URL=<runtime connection string>
# AEGISFLOW_TEST_DATABASE_URL=<disposable test admin connection string>
# Required for HTTP source/evidence authorization (reloads every request):
# AEGISFLOW_SOURCE_ACL_FILE=work/source-acl.json
